{"shortDescription":"RNS Number : 2853Z  Air China Ld  16 October 2026   Hong Kong Exchanges and Clearing Limited and The Stock Exchange of Hong Kong Limited take no responsibility for the contents of this announcement, make no representation as to its accuracy or completeness and expressly disclaim any liability whats…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":["RNS Number : 2853Z  Air China Ld  16 October 2026   ",{"type":"p","children":["Hong Kong Exchanges and Clearing Limited and The Stock Exchange of Hong Kong Limited take no responsibility for the contents of this announcement, make no representation as to its accuracy or completeness and expressly disclaim any liability whatsoever for any loss howsoever arising from or in reliance upon the whole or any part of the contents of this announcement."]},{"type":"p","children":["中國國際航空股份有限公司"]},{"type":"p","children":["AIR CHINA LIMITED"]},{"type":"p","children":["(a joint stock limited company incorporated in the People's Republic of China with limited liability)"]},{"type":"p","children":["(Stock Code: 00753)"]},{"type":"p","children":["ANNOUNCEMENT ON KEY OPERATING DATA OF SEPTEMBER 2026"]},{"type":"p","children":["The enclosed announcement (the \"SSE Announcement\") was published by Air China Limited (\"Air China\") on the Shanghai Stock Exchange on 15 October 2026, which contains combined operating data for September 2026 for Air China and its subsidiaries (collectively, the \"Group\"). This announcement enclosing the SSE Announcement is made by Air China pursuant to Rules 13.09 and 13.10B of the Rules Governing the Listing of Securities on The Stock Exchange of Hong Kong Limited (the \"Listing Rules\") and the Inside Information Provisions (as defined in the Listing Rules) under Part XIVA of the Securities and Futures Ordinance (Chapter 571 of the Laws of Hong Kong)."]},{"type":"p","children":["The data in the enclosed SSE Announcement was calculated based on the internal statistics of the Group, which may differ from the data disclosed in the relative periodic reports. Investors are hereby reminded of the risks which may result from inappropriate reliance upon or utilization of the information given above."]},{"type":"p","children":["By Order of the Board"]},{"type":"p","children":["Air China Limited"]},{"type":"p","children":["Xiao Feng"]},{"type":"p","children":["Company Secretary"]},{"type":"p","children":["Beijing, the PRC, 15 October 2026"]},{"type":"p","children":["As at the date of this announcement, the directors of the Company are Mr. Liu Tiexiang, Mr. Qu Guangji, Mr. Cui Xiaofeng, Mr. Lam Siu Por Ronald, Mr. Xiao Peng, Mr. Xu Niansha*, Mr. He Yun*, Ms. Winnie Tam Wan-chi* and Mr. Gao Chunlei*."]},{"type":"p","children":["*        Independent non-executive director of the Company"]},{"type":"p","children":["SSE ANNOUNCEMENT"]},{"type":"p","children":["The SSE Announcement is written in Chinese, with no official English translation. The English translation is provided solely for reference only. In case of any discrepancy between the two versions, the Chinese version shall prevail. The full version of the SSE Announcement is as follows:"]},{"type":"p","children":["AIR CHINA LIMITED"]},{"type":"p","children":["ANNOUNCEMENT ON KEY OPERATING DATA OF SEPTEMBER 2026"]},{"type":"p","children":["In September 2026, Air China Limited (the \"Company\") and its subsidiaries (the \"Group\") recorded a year-on-year increase in both combined passenger capacity (measured by available seat kilometers (the \"ASK\")) and passenger traffic (measured by revenue passenger kilometers (the \"RPK\")). Passenger capacity recorded a year-on-year increase of 3.5%, and passenger traffic recorded a year-on-year increase of 6.3%. Among which, for domestic routes, passenger capacity decreased by 0.4% year on year, and passenger traffic increased by 2.7% year on year. For international routes, passenger capacity increased by 14.2% year on year, and passenger traffic increased by 16.2% year on year. For regional routes, passenger capacity decreased by 11.3% year on year, and passenger traffic decreased by 4.2% year on year. The passenger load factor was 85.4%, representing an increase of 2.3 percentage points as compared to the same period last year. Among which, the passenger load factor for domestic routes increased by 2.7 percentage points year on year, the passenger load factor for international routes increased by 1.4 percentage points year on year, and the passenger load factor for regional routes increased by 5.9 percentage points year on year."]},{"type":"p","children":["In terms of cargo operations, cargo capacity (measured by available freight tonne kilometers (the \"AFTK\")) increased by 6.3% year on year. Cargo and mail traffic (measured by revenue freight tonne kilometers (the \"RFTK\")) increased by 10.5% year on year. The cargo load factor was 42.5%, representing a year-on-year increase of 1.6 percentage points."]},{"type":"p","children":["With effect from 4 September 2026, the Company launched the new route Beijing Capital-Bucharest-Zagreb with three flights per week."]},{"type":"p","children":["In September 2026, the Group introduced one A320 series aircraft, and retired one B737 series aircraft and two A320 series aircraft. At the end of September 2026, the Group operated a fleet of 974 aircraft, including 436 self-owned aircraft, 258 aircraft under finance lease and 280 aircraft under operating lease."]},{"type":"p","children":["The following table sets forth key operating data of September 2026:"]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-header","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["September 2026"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Year-on-Year"]},{"type":"p","children":["Change (%)1"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Month-on-Month"]},{"type":"p","children"